<title>USA: FSA qualifies three bond issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies three bond issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>FSA said it qualified for insurance three bond issues slated for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Groton-Dunstable SD, Mass., $2.5 million GO bonds.</p>
<p>--Hamburg CSD, N.Y., $14.9 million of school district bonds.</p>
<p>--Lancaster Town, N.Y., $2 million GO bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
